.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tapectl-snapshot-mark-reclaimable 1  "tapectl-snapshot-mark-reclaimable " 
.SH NAME
tapectl\-snapshot\-mark\-reclaimable \- Mark a snapshot as reclaimable (with enforced preconditions)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtapectl snapshot mark\-reclaimable\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] <\fB\-\-version\fR> [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mark a snapshot as reclaimable (with enforced preconditions)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR \fI<VERSION>\fR
Snapshot version
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would be done without making changes
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Override preconditions
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Unit name
